        "original_id": "d259e2f8-7abd-55c1-bf96-c5af5acaadb2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Reitinger, Wim Wenders, Bruno Ganz, Solveig Dommartin\n- Works: Wings of Desire, Faraway, So Close!\n- Topics: film sequel, romantic fantasy film, plot\n\nFacts:\n- In 1987, Wings of Desire was released as a romantic fantasy film directed by Wim Wenders.\n- In Wings of Desire, an angel played by Bruno Ganz falls in love with a lonely trapeze artist played by Solveig Dommartin.\n- Richard Reitinger later reunited with Wim Wenders to write Faraway, So Close!, the sequel to Wings of Desire.",
